# What the Vercel CLI must not upload.
#
# The Git-connected deploy builds in Vercel's cloud and never sees these, but
# `vercel --prod` uploads the working directory — release/ alone is half a
# gigabyte of installers, and the CLI dies on the 100 MB per-file limit before
# it ever reaches the build. dist/ is not needed either: it is this project's
# own build output, regenerated by the build command on Vercel.
release/
dist/
node_modules/
data/
.tmp-*/
tmp/
*.log
*.pid
server.pid
server.out
.env
.env.local
.vercel/
.freebuff/
docs/
.git/
